disableActionPolicies.t.sol
└── when permission is not enabled
│   └── it should revert with PermissionIdNotEnabled
└── when permission is enabled
    ├── when action ID is not enabled for the permission
    │   └── it should complete without changes
    └── when action ID is enabled for the permission
        ├── when policies array is empty
        │   └── it should complete without changes
        ├── when policies array contains invalid policies
        │   └── it should revert or skip invalid policies
        └── when policies array contains valid policies
            ├── when policies are currently enabled for action
            │   ├── when removing policies leaves some policies remaining
            │   │   └── it should remove specified policies and emit events
            │   └── when removing policies leaves no policies remaining
            │       └── it should remove all policies, remove action ID, emit ActionIdDisabled
            └── when policies are not currently enabled for action
                └── it should complete without changes